'' Every bespoke intrinsic grammar in the registry: PRINT with a file number, USING
'' and both separators; OPEN with FOR/ACCESS/AS/LEN; LINE INPUT; INPUT with a prompt;
'' the file and graphics forms of GET and PUT; CLOSE and SEEK; DATA; both forms of ON;
'' SWAP; NAME ... AS; and the generic and graphics forms. (DEFINT is refused in the fb
'' dialect, TKO0409 -- see diagnostics/fb-dialect-refusals.test, T86.)
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-ast tests/parser/src/intrinsics.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-NOT: TKO04
'' GOLDEN: expected/intrinsics.out
